{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POLLYANNA is an action adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic Earth-3.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a quick look at what this experience has to offer: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/cb47432e1c1ade5a05126c70015f0733.poster.avif?t=1773590056\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/cb47432e1c1ade5a05126c70015f0733.webm?t=1773590056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/cb47432e1c1ade5a05126c70015f0733.mp4?t=1773590056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>LIGHT POINTS: Use them wisely!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >POLLYANNA features a unique HP system that differs a bit from most other games in the genre:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light Points serve as your HP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a Light Level meter that's directly connected to how many Light Points you currently have.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use your Light Points to ignore your cooldown timers, giving you more freedom during combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/370186139098b78d3a7a49ecf698cc36.poster.avif?t=1773590056\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/370186139098b78d3a7a49ecf698cc36.webm?t=1773590056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/370186139098b78d3a7a49ecf698cc36.mp4?t=1773590056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT: DASH, SMASH, and SLASH your way through a unique cast of enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your 3 main abilities to face off against:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security robots following orders.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupted beings still roaming the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thematic boss fights each with their own unique fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And... maybe even something else entirely?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/e0470a7b5b2cc03d8727bd86807432c7.poster.avif?t=1773590056\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/e0470a7b5b2cc03d8727bd86807432c7.webm?t=1773590056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/e0470a7b5b2cc03d8727bd86807432c7.mp4?t=1773590056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORATION: Explore the ruins of a forgotten world...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple different areas for you to dive into, each area features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich, immersive atmosphere unique to that region.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of different musical tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles/obstacles blocking the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct characters and story arcs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many mysteries to solve...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/c4db48ecf6ad57627d2b125e71a3d7c5.poster.avif?t=1773590056\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/c4db48ecf6ad57627d2b125e71a3d7c5.webm?t=1773590056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/c4db48ecf6ad57627d2b125e71a3d7c5.mp4?t=1773590056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LORE: Uncover the secrets left behind by your creator...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Guidelines, here you can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming yet unsettling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very distinct soundtrack from the rest of the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal settings exploring wild themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of questions left to answer...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/7ed29b1140e6a9ffb0151088fb180219.poster.avif?t=1773590056\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/7ed29b1140e6a9ffb0151088fb180219.webm?t=1773590056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/7ed29b1140e6a9ffb0151088fb180219.mp4?t=1773590056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have fun and enjoy your time in this atmospheric world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Heh. Can't blame a robot for dreaming.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741470?t=1773590056","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741470?t=1773590056","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/b947210305017f3c6da6ffaf21a6ee36a2fbb696/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773590056","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/b947210305017f3c6da6ffaf21a6ee36a2fbb696/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773590056","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POLLYANNA is an action adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic Earth-3.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a quick look at what this experience has to offer: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/cb47432e1c1ade5a05126c70015f0733.poster.avif?t=1773590056\" width=800 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/cb47432e1c1ade5a05126c70015f0733.webm?t=1773590056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741470/extras/cb47432e1c1ade5a0512